                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyooba mbubonya mbuli ciindi mutebuzi naatebula maila aaimvwi, kuboko kwakwe nikubweza makunka. Kuyooba mbuli kucela kwamakunka mukuti lya-Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo kuyoosyaala zyakuvulula mbuli musamu waolifa nuutikinisigwa. Kulasyaala micelo yobile na yotatwe amutwe wamusamu, na micelo yone na yosanwe mumitabi yaanze yamusamu, mbwaamba Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
